, where $f:\rn\rightarrow{\mathbb R}$ satisfies 
	{\textnormal{(H)}}. If $n\geq3$, then there exist $b\in\rn$, $A\in\mathcal{A}$ and $u_p\in C^{2,\alpha}(\rn)$ such that
	\begin{equation*}
