		\left|u(x)-\left(\frac{1}{2}x'Ax+b\cdot x+u_p(x)\right)\right|\leq C_0(1+|x|)^{2-\min\{n,\beta\}},\ \ \ \forall\ x\in\rn,
		\end{aligned}
