\noindent\textbf{Organization of the paper.} In Section~\ref{section-SLE loop}, we review the explicit relation between the laws of conformal radii and moduli for $\SLE_{8/3}$-type loops. Such relation was implicitly established in~\cite{ARS-Annulus}, and we will provide its proof in Appendix~\ref{appendix} for completeness. Then in Section~\ref{section-backbone-1}, we define a layer structure for the cut points of $B[0,\tau_\mathbbm{D}]$ and solve it explicitly, based on the results of~\cite{cfsx} and Section~\ref{section-SLE loop}. Finally, we finish the proof of Theorem~\ref{thm:backbone} in Section~\ref{section-backbone-2}.

